                "name": "The Wyvern",
                "data": {
                  "whisper": "All jack-a-jaw and neck a knot'd string.",
                  "mysteries": [
                    "Claw marks scored into stone towers. The wingspan was enormous.",
                    "A shepherd village burned from above. One survivor speaks of shadow blotting out the sun.",
                    "A wyvern nest on a clifftop. Eggs the size of wagon wheels. The mother is not here.",
                    "The wyvern circles overhead, watching. It hasn't attacked. It appears to be guarding something below.",
                    "The mother returns. She is ancient — and she was clearly once tamed. By someone long dead.",
                    "The wyvern dives. Her eyes are old with grief. Whatever you carry, she recognizes it."
                  ],
                  "mysteryIdx": 0
